WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:02.702
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:04.370
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:05.438
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:07.039
The United Auto Workers
yesterday

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:08.674
endorsed President Biden.

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:11.945 line:91%
Really?
President Amtrak?

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:14.747
You might as well have endorsed
Usain Bolt.

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:15.915
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.249
In a post
on Truth Social,

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:19.085
former President Trump
said that anyone

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:20.920
who donates
to Nikki Haley's campaign

00:00:20.986 --> 00:00:23.790
will be permanently barred
from the MAGA camp,

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.192
quote, "from this moment forth."

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:27.860
What?

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.195
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:32.131
From this moment forth?
What's going on?

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.466
You know, Trump is stressed

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:36.769
when he starts talking
like a dungeon master.

00:00:36.835 --> 00:00:38.270
[As Trump]
From this moment forth,

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:40.373
all my enemies
shall bow before me.

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:43.009
No, you roll those dice
to see if you have to bow.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:45.144
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.946
Presidential candidate
Nikki Haley premiered

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:49.115
a new campaign ad yesterday
in South Carolina

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:51.651
that calls her, quote,
"America's new chapter."

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.485
As opposed to Trump,
who's aiming to be

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:54.987
more of an epilogue.

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:56.355
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:59.425
According to a new report
from a watchdog group,

00:00:59.491 --> 00:01:01.928
former President Trump's
White House pharmacy

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:04.430
prepared go bags
of prescription medications

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.933
for overseas trips,
including Ambien,

00:01:06.999 --> 00:01:08.467
or as Trump calls it,

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:09.802
"my speechwriter."

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:11.404
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:13.172
Hillary Clinton released
a statement yesterday

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.740
in support of Barbie director
Greta Gerwig

00:01:14.807 --> 00:01:16.041 line:92%
and actress Margot Robbie,

00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:18.344
after they did not receive
Oscar nominations,

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:22.448
and wrote, quote, "You are both
so much more than Kenough."

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:25.952
Oh, my God, Mom,
don't talk to my friends!

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.620
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:30.523
Don't you have
somewhere to Pokémon Go?

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.524
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.591 --> 00:01:34.894
Mom!

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:39.232
I told you when you drove us
to the movie --

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:41.100
Don't quote it!

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:43.102
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:46.105
The House Ethics Committee has
reportedly contacted the woman

00:01:46.171 --> 00:01:47.640
who Florida Congressman
Matt Gaetz

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:50.309
has been accused of sleeping
with when she was a minor.

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.979
If convicted, Gaetz could
serve up to four years

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:54.980
as vice president.

00:01:55.047 --> 00:01:57.416
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:01:57.483 --> 00:02:00.853
Ring a little too true?

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.689
Officials at a British zoo
have reintegrated

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:06.959
a pair of profanity-spewing
parrots with their flock

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.928
in hopes it will help
clean up their language.

00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:11.097
And I don't know
what they've been saying,

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:14.534
but if British people
are offended, you know it's bad.

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.602
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:19.438
According to a new ranking
by The Wall Street Journal,

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:23.309
Alaska Airlines was the second
best domestic carrier of 2023.

00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:26.379
They really blew the doors
off the competition.

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:27.780
I know, it's...

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:28.882
Yeah.

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:33.653
I'm guessing voting for that
was a couple months ago.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.654
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.721 --> 00:02:37.890
And finally, today
was National Florida Day.

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:39.659
To learn more
about Florida's history,

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:41.160
go to school somewhere else.

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:42.995
And, you guys...

00:02:43.061 --> 00:02:44.664
that was a monologue.

